      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        378.2156066894531,
        527.0026245117188,
        391.3606262207031
      ],
      "text": "Determine training, competency and quality assessment needs by setting and by cadre of",
